{"sha": "9d2116380e3aa5dd1b0b5655b4259058bcd448deca29dde5067d1e3ce60de42f", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "对 $K_i = [\\mathrm{ML}_i]/([\\mathrm{ML}_{i-1}][\\mathrm{L}])$ 取对数：", "$\\log K_i = \\log\\frac{[\\mathrm{ML}_i]}{[\\mathrm{ML}_{i-1}]} + \\mathrm{pL}$.", "两种形式在 $\\mathrm{pL} = \\log K_i$ 时相等，比值", "随 pL 每变化一个单位而变为十倍。$\\mathrm{ML}_i$ 的区域位于", "$\\log K_{i+1}$ 与 $\\log K_i$ 之间，只有当 $\\log K_{i+1} < \\log", "K_i$ 时才存在。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[绘制 pL 图]\\label{met:b1:complexation:pl-diagram}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 由 $\\log\\beta_n$ 依次算出各 $\\log K_i$。", "  \\item 若它们递减，则把每个都画在 pL 轴上的边界处：", "        配体最多的配合物在左侧（pL 较小），游离", "        离子在右侧。", "  \\item 若某个 $\\log K_{i+1} > \\log K_i$，则配合物 $\\mathrm{ML}_i$ 没有", "        区域：它会自身反应，生成 $\\mathrm{ML}_{i-1}$ 和", "        $\\mathrm{ML}_{i+1}$。去掉它，在", "        $\\mathrm{ML}_{i-1}$ 与 $\\mathrm{ML}_{i+1}$ 之间画一条单一边界，", "        位于 $\\frac12(\\log K_i + \\log K_{i+1})$ 处。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[", "  width=0.78\\linewidth, height=5.2cm, xmin=0, xmax=7, ymin=0, ymax=1.05,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={$\\mathrm{pNH_3}$},", "  ylabel={铜的分数},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=pL, y=M] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-ammine-distribution-copper.dat};", "\\addplot[omProp, thick] table[x=pL, y=ML] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-ammine-distribution-copper.dat};", "\\addplot[omMeth, thick] table[x=pL, y=ML2] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-ammine-distribution-copper.dat};", "\\addplot[black!60, thick] table[x=pL, y=ML3] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-ammine-distribution-copper.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, very thick] table[x=pL, y=ML4] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-ammine-distribution-copper.dat};", "\\node[omDef, font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.15,0.78) {$n = 4$};", "\\node[black!60, font=\\small] at (axis cs:2.42,0.63) {3};", "\\node[omMeth, font=\\small] at (axis cs:3.12,0.55) {2};", "\\node[omProp, font=\\small] at (axis cs:3.76,0.58) {1};", "\\node[omThm, font=\\small, anchor=east] at (axis cs:6.9,0.84) {\\ce{Cu^2+}};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1.25cm]", "  \\draw[->, thick] (0,0) -- (7.2,0) node[right] {$\\mathrm{pNH_3}$};", "  \\foreach \\x/\\l in {2.03/2.03, 2.82/2.82, 3.41/3.41, 4.10/4.10}", "    \\draw (\\x,0.12) -- (\\x,-0.12) node[below] {\\l};", "  \\node[above] at (1.0,0.08) {$[\\ce{Cu(NH3)4}]^{2+}$};", "  \\node[above, font=\\scriptsize] at (2.42,0.08) {3};", "  \\node[above, font=\\scriptsize] at (3.12,0.08) {2};", "  \\node[above, font=\\scriptsize] at (3.76,0.08) {1};", "  \\node[above] at (5.6,0.08) {\\ce{Cu^2+}};", "  \\begin{scope}[yshift=-1.25cm]", "  \\draw[->, thick] (0,0) -- (7.2,0) node[right] {$\\mathrm{pNH_3}$};", "  \\draw (3.61,0.12) -- (3.61,-0.12) node[below] {3.61};", "  \\draw[dotted] (3.32,0.3) -- (3.32,-0.1); \\draw[dotted] (3.90,0.3) -- (3.90,-0.1);", "  \\node[above] at (1.6,0.08) {$[\\ce{Ag(NH3)2}]^{+}$};", "  \\node[above] at (5.4,0.08) {\\ce{Ag+}};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 上图：铜（II）以 \\ce{Cu^2+} 及", "$[\\ce{Cu(NH3)_n}]^{2+}$（$n = 1$ 至 4）形式存在的分数，随 $\\mathrm{pNH_3}$ 变化。中图：", "铜氨配合物的优势区域图，边界位于", "$\\log K_i$ 处。下图：银，其中 $\\log K_2 = 3.90 > \\log K_1 = 3.32$", "（虚线）：$[\\ce{AgNH3}]^{+}$ 无区域，单一边界位于", "$\\frac12\\log\\beta_2 = 3.61$ 处。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[\\texorpdfstring{\\qty{0.010}{mol/L}}{0.010 mol/L} 氨水中的铜]\\label{ex:b1:complexation:cu}", "游离 $[\\ce{NH3}] = \\qty{0.010}{mol/L}$ 时，$\\mathrm{pNH_3} = 2.0$ 位于", "$[\\ce{Cu(NH3)3}]^{2+}$ 的区域内，但靠近 2.03 处的", "与 $[\\ce{Cu(NH3)4}]^{2+}$ 的边界，二者几乎相等。各组分的分数", "正比于 $\\beta_n[\\ce{NH3}]^n = 10^{\\log\\beta_n - 2n}$，即", "$1 : 10^{2.10} : 10^{3.51} : 10^{4.33} : 10^{4.36}$，故 \\qty{48}{\\percent} 为", "$[\\ce{Cu(NH3)4}]^{2+}$，\\qty{45}{\\percent} 为 $[\\ce{Cu(NH3)3}]^{2+}$，", "\\qty{7}{\\percent} 为 $[\\ce{Cu(NH3)2}]^{2+}$，几乎没有游离的 \\ce{Cu^2+}。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{竞争}", "", "一个配体可被两种金属离子争夺，一个金属离子也可被两个配体争夺，", "二者还都参与沉淀平衡和酸--碱平衡。", "每一种竞争都是一个新的反应，其常数由", "已知常数组合而成；", "\\cref{ch:b1:predominant-reaction}中的主反应方法原样适用。", "", "\\begin{example}[铁（III）的两种配体]\\label{ex:b1:complexation:scn-f}", "向铁（III）溶液中滴入一滴硫氰根，生成血红色的", "$[\\ce{FeSCN}]^{2+}$；氟离子使其褪色：", "\\[", "  [\\ce{FeSCN}]^{2+} + \\ce{F-} \\rightleftharpoons [\\ce{FeF}]^{2+} + \\ce{SCN-},", "  \\qquad K = \\frac{\\beta(\\ce{FeF})}{\\beta(\\ce{FeSCN})} = 10^{6.85 - 2.96} =", "  10^{3.89} .", "\\]", "稳定性较强（$\\beta$ 较大）的配合物夺得金属离子，", "正如较强的酸把质子让给较强的碱。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[配合作用与沉淀的竞争]\\label{prop:b1:complexation:competition-precipitation}", "固体 MX 在配体 L 中溶解，反应为", "$\\mathrm{MX(s)} + n\\,\\mathrm{L} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{ML}_n + \\mathrm{X}$,", "其平衡常数为 $K = \\beta_n K_s$。若配合物是溶液中 M 的唯一存在形式，", "且游离配体浓度为 $[\\mathrm{L}]$，则", "溶解度为 $s = \\sqrt{K}\\,[\\mathrm{L}]^{n/2}$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "该反应是溶解（常数 $K_s$）与", "$\\mathrm{ML}_n$ 生成（$\\beta_n$）之和。饱和时 $[\\mathrm{ML}_n]", "= [\\mathrm{X}] = s$ 且 $K = s^2/[\\mathrm{L}]^n$。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}